.TH AVR\-GROUP\-LIMIT 1 "" "avr" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-group-limit \- Show, set and clear a group's vCPU limit.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr group limit
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show, set and clear a group's vCPU limit.
.PP
A group's vCPU limit caps the vCPU that the group and its subgroups use at once. Limits on parent groups apply too: a job starts only when it fits under every limit on its group's path, counting what the other groups below each one already use.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
clear
Remove a group's own vCPU limit.
.TP
list
Show the limits that apply to a group, its own and inherited.
.TP
set
Set a group's own vCPU limit.
